<< /A << /BBox [ 69.4488 419.244 525.373 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Bar chart comparing preference for video visits over in-person visits for health care types under two scenarios: same-day availability \(dark blue\) and video visit in one week versus in-person in one month \(light blue\). For health issues, 60.1% prefer video visits on same day, 72.1% in one week vs. one month. For mental health care, 44.4% and 70.0%, respectively. For specialty care, 21.9% and 52.9%, respectively. Below, a graphic of a doctor in a monitor is shown, alongside three semicircle gauge charts displaying percentages of people who switched to video visits because of wait-time: 44.1% for primary care, 42.4% for mental health care, and 49% for specialty care.) /K 10 /Lang (en-EN) /P 302 0 R /Pg 189 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
